  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The SceneTree component manages the hierarchical visualization of entities within the game scene, acting as a crucial bridge between the core engine data model and the editor UI. It is responsible for rendering the scene structure, handling user interactions like selection, toggling visibility, and managing entity instantiation via context menus. It synchronizes its state by subscribing to updates from EditorService and SceneTreeService."
  },
